🔴 THE SYMBOL SPACE IS PART OF THE ANSWER, NOT A DETAIL. The same event is
carried in one space and declined in the other. Asking the wrong space returns
exactly what "not entitled" returns: silence. Measured on QQQ (equity space)
and .QQQ260922C500/505/510 (option space).

